---
layout: base.njk
permalink: /stays/
title: Stays
description: "Every place I have stayed, browsable by type. Camping, hotels, rural boltholes, hot tubs, saunas, forest cabins, beaches and pools."
---
<section class="pagehead">
  <p class="label">{{ atlas.totals.stays }} stays · {{ atlas.totals.types }} types</p>
  <h1 class="pagehead__title">Stays</h1>
  <p class="pagehead__lede">
    Every place I have actually slept, with an honest review of each. Browse by
    what you want out of it rather than by country.
  </p>
</section>

<section class="typegrid">
  {%- for t in atlas.types %}
  <a class="type" href="{{ t.url }}" data-reveal>
    <span class="type__name">{{ t.name }}</span>
    <span class="type__blurb">{{ t.blurb }}</span>
    <span class="type__meta mono">{{ t.stayCount }} stays{% if t.fromPrice %} · from {{ t.fromPrice | money }}{% endif %}</span>
  </a>
  {%- endfor %}
</section>

<section class="listing">
  <p class="label" data-reveal>All stays</p>
  <div class="index-table" data-reveal>
    {%- for s in atlas.stays %}
    <a class="index-row" href="{{ s.url }}">
      <span class="index-row__time mono">{{ s.rating }}/5</span>
      <span class="index-row__name">{{ s.name }}</span>
      <span class="index-row__place">{{ s.placeName }}, {{ s.countryName }}</span>
      <span class="index-row__type">{{ s.kind }}</span>
      <span class="index-row__price">{{ s.price | money }}</span>
    </a>
    {%- endfor %}
  </div>
</section>
